# Optional: swap the offline defaults for a real Anthropic model on the
# generation-side faithfulness metrics. Retrieval metrics are unaffected.
# Copy to .env and fill in, or export these in your shell.

# RAG_EVAL_LLM=anthropic       # grounded answer generation with claude-opus-4-8
# RAG_EVAL_JUDGE=anthropic     # LLM-as-judge faithfulness scoring
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... # or use an `ant auth login` profile
